        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a2429d84-2b78-42c4-a88d-82b8984ca92d).Image",
        "Description": "AGENT 47, We’ve been notified that a new international threat has found its way to Chongqing. Angus Pritchard, an agent for a new group called P.A.R.I.S (Poison All Reasonable Independent Statesmen) has been looking to kill a national dignitary. He’s disguised himself as a world renown cook and snobbish food critic. He is looking to cause some trouble, so you might want to make sure he misses his next taste test. Make sure there is one less cook in this kitchen and do it swiftly.",
